    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bohan Hyland & Associates are thrilled to present 5 Station Road to market. This three bedroom semi-detached house built in 1920 comes to market with no onward chain providing a quick turnaround for a willing buyer and is presented in good order throughout.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to first/second time buyers and investors alike and is ideally located on Station Road close to all local amenities (shops, schools, pubs, parks, bus routes etc) and is just a short drive away from the newly revamped Liffey Valley Shopping Centre. The N4, N7 and M50 road networks are in close proximity.\r\n\r\nThis home briefly comprises of a dual aspect sitting room to the front, kitchen/diner to the rear aspect, one double bedroom, family bathroom and utility space downstairs. Upstairs we have a two further bedrooms, one with ensuite bathroom. To the rear is a large south-east facing garden and to the front and side aspect can be found a wraparound driveway providing off street parking for multiple cars. Many additional benefits include double glazed windows, newly fitted gas-fired central heating and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nTo view this property call Shane Hanevy today on 01 491 3000."
      },
